  "details": "We can learn this from a game a lot of people loved (recroom((Rip))) weather your not playing VRChat or your not in the same instance you might want to speak to people even if you cant be in their instance. This also adds another desirable aspect to VRChat for people who dont like or dont have discord, in the sense of if you have VR friends and you have no other way to talk outside of VRChat you can use this to keep in touch if your somewhere you cant pull out a phone/laptop and open VRChat changing the longer conversation that you might not have time to a short \"hey when you said x did you mean y or z.\" preferably this feature would be accessible to the game, website, AND mobile app but with the more limited ui the mobile app has compared to the website the app could be skipped for just the website and game. I hope you understood the reasoning in this and consider using this to better your social experience (even though we already know its great without help lol.)",
